Package: lexcore
Title: Common Data Structures for Legal Data Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kristian", "Veps<c3><a4>l<c3><a4>inen", , "kristian.vepsalainen@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Defines standard data structures for legislation, citations and legal texts, and converters from jurisdiction-specific packages such as 'finlex', 'swelex', 'danlex' and 'eurlex'. Forms the foundation of the 'lexverse' ecosystem.
